#ASSERT `Can I get this qualification this way, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `class A` `being assessed competent, after training with an employer` EQUALS yes

-- s 60E: Liam's contract has every limb; two employers without approval, or Jake's enrolment with no employer, do not.
