#ASSERT `May my contract be terminated, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `my employer` `after probation, without consent or approval` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May my contract be terminated, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `my employer` `after probation, approved by the chief executive` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May my contract be terminated, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `me, the apprentice` `after probation, without consent or approval` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Has my employer committed an offence by ending my contract, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `after probation, without consent or approval` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Has my employer committed an offence by ending my contract, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `in probation, without my consent` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Has my employer committed an offence by ending my contract, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `no probation period, without my consent` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `What must the chief executive do, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `I have engaged in serious misconduct` EQUALS `the answer is` `must approve the termination, if satisfied the reason exists`
#ASSERT `What must the chief executive do, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` `some other reason` EQUALS `the answer is` `may refuse to approve the termination`

