-- Appeals and disputes.
#ASSERT `May I appeal to the Commission, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `the chief executive refusing to register my contract` FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I appeal to the Commission, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `a training provider refusing me a qualification` FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May I appeal to the Commission, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `a training provider refusing me a qualification` TRUE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May the Commission do this on my appeal, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `award me compensation` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May the Commission do this on my appeal, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `confirm the decision` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Where can I take my dispute, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `the Act and its regulations set up no forum for it`
#ASSERT `Where can I take my dispute, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the answer is` `to the chief executive or an appointee, then on appeal to the Industrial Relations Commission`
#ASSERT `Where can I take my dispute, as I ask it` `as the apprentice` `registered` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the answer is` `to the chief executive or an appointee, with no appeal under the Act`

